NAME
     cal - a calendar

SYNOPSIS
     cal [-m] [-y] [-1|-3] [[MONTH] YEAR]

DESCRIPTION
     cal prints this month, or the month and year given.

OPTIONS
     -m   weeks begin on Monday
     -y   the whole year
     -1   one month (the default)
     -3   the month before, this one, and the month after

SEE ALSO
     date(1)
